  "notes": "USAGE:\nCommon in business, government, and organizational contexts. Often used at the end of a period or project to review what happened overall. The pattern {総括|そうかつ}を{行|おこな}う (conduct a review) is standard in formal settings.\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {要約|ようやく}: summary (condensing content)\n- まとめ: summary, wrap-up (casual)\n- {概括|がいかつ}: general summary, outline\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {総括|そうかつ}を{行|おこな}う: conduct a summary/review\n- {年度|ねんど}{総括|そうかつ}: annual review\n- {総括|そうかつ}{報告|ほうこく}: summary report\n- {総括|そうかつ}{的|てき}: comprehensive, overall",
